column1:
%s could not find a suitable default browser and is therefore unable to provide the information you requested. Please install Google Chrome or Mozilla Firefox. If you wish to use a different web browser, please place the following in your %s/preferences file:

pref.webBrowser = "/path/to/browser"||%s 找不到合适的默认浏览器，因此无法提供你请求的信息。请安装 Google Chrome 或 Mozilla Firefox。如果你想使用其他 Web 浏览器，请将以下内容放入你的 %s/preferences 文件中：

pref.webBrowser = &quot;/path/to/browser&quot;
